OL,3,A'We couldn't give up that easily':     
OL,4,AMarching bands scramble to cover costs 
OL,5,Aafter Thanksgiving parade rearranged   
OL,7,FSince New York City officials postponed
OL,8,Fthe Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade, a  
OL,9,Fprecaution ahead of a storm that       
OL,10,Fbrought heavy rain, wind and flooding, 
OL,11,Fhundreds of touring performers who     
OL,12,Ftraveled from across the US to perform 
OL,13,Fwere thrust into chaos.                
OL,15,F"It was jarring," said Ryan Demkovich, 
OL,16,Fdirector of a Texas high school        
OL,17,Fmarching band. After learning the news,
OL,18,Fhe had to scramble to make new         
OL,19,Farrangements for over 500 people.      
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
